  Worktrees panels and the usage bar.
- cockpit/mods/cockpit-agents, cockpit-changes, cockpit-files, cockpit-menu,
  cockpit-new-menu, cockpit-pane, cockpit-spaces, cockpit-tabs, cockpit-workspace-chrome
  and cockpit-workspace-status: Herdr 0.1.16's shipped mods of the same names without the
  prefix, modified. cockpit-changes and cockpit-files are largely rewritten.
- The icons in those folders come with them (Lucide, ISC License).

cockpit/mods/usage-limits is `usage-limits` from VladTemp27/herdr-mods
(https://github.com/VladTemp27/herdr-mods), Copyright 2026 VladTemp27, licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0. The only change is the corner radius in main.js. Its own
notice says: usage-limits asks the claude and codex CLIs for usage the way Joseph Malicki's
jmalicki/herdr-mod-ai-usage (https://github.com/jmalicki/herdr-mod-ai-usage, MIT) does; no
code is copied from it.

cockpit/mods/cockpit-pulls/git-pull-request*.svg are Octicons
(https://github.com/primer/octicons), MIT License, Copyright (c) GitHub Inc.

cockpit/mods/cockpit-files/file-plus.svg and cockpit-worktrees/worktree.svg are Lucide
